{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"查询开发者应用（APPID）下最近7天请求过的不活跃账户，平台建议降低此类账户的请求频次或无需请求。不活跃账户指客户在至少90天内没有任何活跃行为。目前仅支持返回巨量营销下的不活跃账户列表，查询结果为T+1，可在次日10点后更新同步。请求时需传入应用级别token。\",\"id\":\"tools.inactive_advertiser.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/inactive_advertiser/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1834548530596872\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口时需传入通过该接口获取的应用级token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取APP Access Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1834548530596872\",\"title\":\"获取不活跃账户列表\"}",
