em mulit-codeblock-header-item-active\">Python</div><div class=\"mulit-codeblock-header-item\">Java</div><div class=\"mulit-codeblock-header-item\">Php</div><div class=\"mulit-codeblock-header-item\">Curl</div></div><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 640px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content python\"></div><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content java\"></div><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content php\"></div><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content curl\"></div></div></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-9KiliJPZ\" id=\"h346b9f0-9KiliJPZ\">应答字段</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"response\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">code</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">返回码,详见 <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\">【附录-返回码】</a></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">message</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">返回信息,详见 <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\">【附录-返回码】</a></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>json</p></section><section class=\"col description\">json返回值</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">list</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Rj8sGRBY\">不活跃账户信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lKAYnKoU\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Pde57gm0\">当advertiser_type = <code>INACTIVE</code>时，代表不活跃客户ID，指客户在至少90天内未活跃，结合未产生消耗、没有营销新建/编辑行为、无余额、无开启中计划等条件综合判断</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bRa40vRD\">当advertiser_type = <code>30_DAY_NO_COST</code>时，代表不活跃客户ID，30天无消耗客户ID，建议您降低请求频次或提升账户消耗以帮助您在接口下获取更多的可分配QPS。</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">last_request_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hEhBbNYh\">该APPID最后一次请求投放账户的日期</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-FbN9qgxx\">仅当advertiser_type=<code>INACTIVE</code>时返回</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uw7UM6Y1\">我们将为您返回<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">最近7天有请求过的不活跃客户列表</span>，建议您降低此类客户的请求频次，如继续高频请求将触发请求限流报错</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-b88slET1\">页码游标值</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_more</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\">是否有下一页</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">request_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求日志id</section></section></secti